{}	base	kar_psthab	past habitual	\N	Person marking is identical to the normal <a href='/construction/kar_main'>Kari'ña main clause</a>, except for third person, where <i><a href='/morpheme/kar_3i'>Ø/i-</a></i> and <i>t(ɨ)-</i> are found. <i><a href='/morpheme/kar_3i'>Ø/i-</a></i> occurs as a 3>3 marker, <i>t(ɨ)-</i> occurs with intransitive verbs and can be used with transitive verbs to express a passive meaning:  <blockquote style='margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px'>     (<a href='/example/kar-45'>1</a>) <a href='/languages/kar'>Kari'ña</a> (<a href='/sources/courtz2008carib'>Courtz 2008</a>: 88)     <div class="sentence-wrapper"><div class="sentence"><div class="body"><div class="gloss-box"><div class="gloss-unit"><div class="word"><text><a href="/morpheme/kar_cor">tɨ</a>-kupi-to</text></div><div class="gloss">3-bathe-PST.HAB</div></div></div><div class="translation">He used to be bathed.</div></div></div></div> </blockquote>\n<table class="table paradigm-table"><caption>Transitive person marking</caption><tr><td class="td paradigm-td"> </td><td class="td paradigm-td">1P</td><td class="td paradigm-td">2P</td><td class="td paradigm-td">1+2P</td><td class="td paradigm-td">1+3P</td><td class="td paradigm-td">3P</td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">1A</td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_12'>k(ɨ)-</a></i></td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_1a'>s(i)-</a></i></td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">2A</td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_12'>k(ɨ)-</a></i></td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_13pro'>(n)aʔna</a></i> <i><a href='/morpheme/kar_2a'>m(i)-</a></i></td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_2a'>m(i)-</a></i></td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">1+2A</td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_12a'>kɨs(i)-</a></i></td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">1+3A</td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td">? </td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td><td class="td paradigm-td">? </td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">3A</td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_1p'>ɨ(j)-</a></i></td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_2p'>a(j)-/o-</a></i></td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_12'>k(ɨ)-</a></i></td><td class="td paradigm-td">? </td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_3i'>Ø/i-</a></i></td></tr></table><table class="table paradigm-table"><caption>Intransitive person marking</caption><tr><td class="td paradigm-td"> </td><td class="td paradigm-td"></td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">1</td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_1p'>ɨ(j)-</a></i>, <i><a href='/morpheme/kar_1sa'>w-</a></i></td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">2</td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_2p'>a(j)-/o-</a></i>, <i><a href='/morpheme/kar_2sa'>m-</a></i></td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">1+2</td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_12'>k(ɨ)-</a></i>, <i><a href='/morpheme/kar_12sa'>kɨt-</a></i></td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">1+3</td><td class="td paradigm-td">? </td></tr><tr><td class="td paradigm-td">3</td><td class="td paradigm-td"><i><a href='/morpheme/kar_cor'>t(ɨ)-</a></i>, <i><a href='/morpheme/kar_3i'>Ø/i-</a></i></td></tr></table>	\N	21	10	2	1	2021-01-14 10:01:06.714643+00	2021-01-14 10:01:06.714643+00	t	\N
